  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>허<ruby>쥐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>믕<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’릐</span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FfgdYsKyzHA?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>落雨<rt>롷허ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>暗暝<rt>암ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yu-kôh-si-loh-hōr’e àm-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>潑<rt>퐣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>熄<rt>싣</rt></ruby> <ruby>滿腹<rt>뫄ˆ박ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酸苦味<rt>승ˉ커ˆ삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hor-jùi phoâh-boe-sit moâ-pâk-sn̄g-khôr-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想起<rt>슐키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>當時<rt>덩ˉ시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>兩人<rt>능랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>淋雨<rt>람허ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>滋味<rt>주ˉ삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-khî-tioh-hît-tōng-sí nng-láng lam-hōr&#8217;e jū-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>如今<rt>뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>賰<rt>춘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>往事<rt>엉ˆ수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>稀微<rt>히ˉ삐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ru-kîm chūn-ông-sū lêh-hī-bí\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>借<rt>죻</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>醉<rt>쥐ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>死<rt>시ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jioh’tio jit-puē-jiù siṵ-bêh-jùi-hor-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>샹<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>傷心<rt>셩ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>愈來愈<rt>뚜ˆ래뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>清醒<rt>촁ˉ칠ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siáng jāi-siōng-sîm si-rû-lai-rû-chiēng-chḭ̀\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>賭氣<rt>더ˆ키</rt></ruby> <ruby>可比<rt>코ˆ비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>拄<rt>두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>風颱<rt>헝ˉ태ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-kâm-jiéng lai-tôr-khi khô-pî-tû-tioh-hōng-thāi-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心疼<rt>심ˉ턀</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>像<rt>츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>撥<rt>봫ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>離<rt>리ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-thia̰ tio-chiṵ-hor-jùi poâh-boe-lī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ hor-jùi goà mng-lì goà’e kâm-jiéng sǹg-siâ̰-mîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>彩<rt>채ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-chài ài-lì î-kiēng-ai jiâh-joe-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby> <ruby>賭<rt>더ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>生死<rt>셀ˉ시ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ hor-jùi goà mng-lì siâ̰-láng wi-ai tôr-sḛ̄-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>陪<rt>붸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kâ̰-kòng goà tio-pue-lî-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>淋<rt>람ˊ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>冷冷<rt>롕ˆ롕ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn lám&#8217;tio liêng-lièng&#8217;e hor-jùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>奈<rt>내-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>身邊<rt>신ˉ빌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-nai-lì î-kiēng-bo-tiàm-gûn-sīn-pḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>放<rt>방ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jāi-lì ti-tô-wī kâm-u-jiōng-gùn pàng-boe-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>借<rt>죻ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn jî-u-jiôh-hor-jùi lai-siṵ̄’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>借<rt>죻</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>醉<rt>쥐ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>死<rt>시ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jioh’tio jit-puē-jiù siṵ-bêh-jùi-hor-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>샹<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>傷心<rt>셩ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>愈來愈<rt>뚜ˆ래뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>清醒<rt>촁ˉ칠ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siáng jāi-siōng-sîm si-rû-lai-rû-chiēng-chḭ̀\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>賭氣<rt>더ˆ키</rt></ruby> <ruby>可比<rt>코ˆ비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>拄<rt>두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>風颱<rt>헝ˉ태ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-kâm-jiéng lai-tôr-khi khô-pî-tû-tioh-hōng-thāi-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心疼<rt>심ˉ턀</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>像<rt>츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>撥<rt>봫ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>離<rt>리ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-thia̰ tio-chiṵ-hor-jùi poâh-boe-lī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ hor-jùi goà mng-lì goà’e kâm-jiéng sǹg-siâ̰-mîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>彩<rt>채ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-chài ài-lì î-kiēng-ai jiâh-joe-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby> <ruby>賭<rt>더ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>生死<rt>셀ˉ시ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ hor-jùi goà mng-lì siâ̰-láng wi-ai tôr-sḛ̄-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>陪<rt>붸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kâ̰-kòng goà tio-pue-lî-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>淋<rt>람ˊ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>冷冷<rt>롕ˆ롕ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n